Column C appears to answer one question: does any size in column A also appear in column B? The False rows support this. Rows 18, 29 and 42 share no sizes between the two lists. Row 16 is an exception: column B is the placeholder "[Person_2]", which shares no sizes with column A, yet column C shows True. So that row doesn't fit the pattern. I've assumed D2 is meant to compute the same check.

